<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TPN year profits fall, dividend cut.</title>
<headline>TPN year profits fall, dividend cut.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.9	   vs 8.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)  2.8 making 4.2	   vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.45	  vs 4.02</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.49	  vs 6.92</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.04	  vs 2.89</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.13	  vs 0.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		  44.76	 vs 43.13</p>
<p>Div payable October 25</p>
<p>on register October 11</p>
<p>Full name: TPN Investments Ltd (industrial fasteners)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said increased competition sliced into margins in the year</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
